f3c1af692b579add991861e1f7c4950f6af39932
commit 753ed75f299eb7d693df490a7a36834599199de4
Author: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>
Commit: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>

    libcxx: allow forced unwind through condition-variable waits
    
    Remove the non-throwing specifications from the four wait entry points,
    including matching declarations and the C++03 mirrors. Keep notification
    specifications unchanged. This allows deferred thread cancellation to
    continue through the wait boundary; ordinary system errors may propagate
    as well. Compatibility for previously linked consumers is handled by a
    separate symbol-version change.
    
    Validation: native x86_64 libc++/libc++abi and matched baseline builds pass
    with compiler warnings treated as errors. Four wait shapes each pass five
    cancel/join/cleanup assertions against the complete rebuilt library.
    Evidence: https://github.com/lhmax2010/libc-_replacement/tree/codex/runtime-validation/docs/progress/IMPL_0908/W1
    
    中文说明：解除四种等待的异常规格并同步声明与 C++03 镜像；不改变通知
    接口。强制展开可继续执行沿途清理，普通错误也可以向上传播。旧调用方的
    兼容版本另行提交。验证记录包含完整库构建和每格五次的具体行为断言。

commit 2b94110f0ef5e036a17e8cfea80d0c69b0330935
Author: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>
Commit: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>

    libcxx: roll back interrupted shared-mutex writer reservations
    
    Create a local completion guard after reserving the writer bit in ordinary
    and timed exclusive acquisition. On an incomplete exit, clear only that
    bit and notify the first gate while the internal mutex remains locked.
    Mark successful completion and the existing timed-out cleanup as complete
    so that normal paths retain their original state transitions.
    
    No object members or layout are changed. This does not claim asynchronous
    cancellation safety or coverage of arbitrary user Clock and callback code.
    Validation: native x86_64 strict-warning runtime build and header value
    smoke pass; the guard follows the previously validated ordinary/timed
    writer rollback shape, including its normal-timeout completion rule.
    Evidence: https://github.com/lhmax2010/libc-_replacement/tree/codex/runtime-validation/docs/progress/IMPL_0908/W1
    
    中文说明：普通与定时写者在置写者位后创建守卫；异常离开时在内部锁仍被
    持有的阶段清写者位、通知第一等待队列。成功及正常超时显式标记完成，
    不增加对象成员，不扩展为任意异步取消或用户回调均安全的承诺。

commit aafbe73ba928785fff19baf964b5a31c33be91b8
Author: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>
Commit: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>

    libcxx: make wbuffer_convert destruction independent of synchronization
    
    Do not call __close from the destructor. Keep codecvt and buffer deletion
    unchanged, and retain the helper with a comment recording that this class
    no longer calls it internally. Callers requiring complete output must use
    pubsync explicitly before destruction.
    
    Validation: strict-warning native runtime build and five repeated exact
    output checks. Explicit synchronization preserves all six sample bytes;
    without it the already-emitted first byte remains and the five buffered
    bytes are not emitted during destruction. Resource deletion code and ABI
    annotations are unchanged.
    Evidence: https://github.com/lhmax2010/libc-_replacement/tree/codex/runtime-validation/docs/progress/IMPL_0908/W1
    
    中文说明：析构不再自动同步，资源删除及 ABI 标注保持不变；保留 __close
    本身并标注此类已无内部调用。显式同步的输出完整性与不显式同步的内容差异
    已逐值验证，不能把不自动刷新误写为写入过程中完全没有输出。

commit 72e7a0f21ceeb1a2a4de60fc5137be194c748b90
Author: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>
Commit: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>

    libcxx: retain versioned condition-variable wait contracts
    
    Keep non-throwing ordinary and system-clock wait wrappers at LLVM_22 and
    publish throwing implementations as the LLVM_22_TIZEN_1 defaults. Share
    the existing wait bodies and use public native_handle() access rather
    than private-member tricks or object-layout casts. The ELF member aliases
    use an explicit this argument and retain the existing parameter ABI.
    
    Enable this platform-specific scheme for the shared runtime through an
    opt-in CMake option and the package recipe. Remove helper assembler names
    and also localize their namespace in the version map. Header-only clock
    overloads have no library symbol hook and still require recompilation.
    
    Validation: a full native x86_64 libc++/libc++abi build, dynamic symbol
    inspection, four caller/linking cases repeated five times, and both timed
    entry versions repeated five times. The old quiet object relinked to the
    new default retains its lock; this is an observed compatibility limit,
    not a claim that all old object layouts behave identically.
    Evidence: https://github.com/lhmax2010/libc-_replacement/tree/codex/runtime-validation/docs/progress/IMPL_0908/W2
    
    中文说明：普通和 system-clock 等待保留 LLVM_22 不抛出包装，新增默认
    LLVM_22_TIZEN_1；公开 native_handle 取得原生对象，不猜私有布局。
    真实库的四种绑定与两个定时入口共 30 次值断言通过；旧目标文件重链接
    不能补回编译时缺失的清理路径，头文件内联入口仍须重编。

commit f3c1af692b579add991861e1f7c4950f6af39932
Author: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>
Commit: He Fangyu <fangyu.he@samsung.com>

    libcxx: match timed-wait aliases to the target intmax_t ABI
    
    The chrono ratio parameters use intmax_t. Its Itanium name encodes long
    on the supported LP64 target but long long on armv7l. The original alias
    spelling exported the LP64 name on ARM as well, so normal timed-wait
    callers failed to link despite a successful shared-library build.
    
    Select the spelling from the target long width and assert the exact
    intmax_t type at compile time. Keep both version contracts, native-handle
    access and all waiting algorithms unchanged. This is a follow-up fix;
    the previously published implementation commits are not rewritten.
    
    Validation: compare both aliases against each architecture's actual
    single-version baseline export, and rebuild both complete runtimes.
    The original ARM link failure and the independent undefined-symbol
    comparison are retained with the two-architecture validation evidence.
    Evidence: https://github.com/lhmax2010/libc-_replacement/tree/codex/runtime-validation/docs/progress/IMPL_0908/W3
    
    中文说明：ARM 的 ratio 非类型参数使用 long long，符号编码为 x；原先
    复用 x86_64 的 l 编码导致定时等待调用方无法链接。按目标类型选择并做
    静态断言，不改版本契约、等待算法或既有提交；失败原文与逐架构旧库对照保留。
commit c3f8578a4db871d9d6de96d751f4c2ea7b1638fa
Author: hao.lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
Commit: hao.lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>

    packaging: select Clang explicitly for libc++ runtimes
    
    Select the target-prefixed Clang drivers directly in the libc++ runtimes
    CMake configuration.  The previous package-local _toolchain_override did
    not affect the RPM compiler macros in the Tizen-Base build environment, so
    GCC was still selected and rejected the Clang-only --rtlib=libgcc option.
    
    When an aarch64 GCC-default environment invokes this Clang-only package,
    normalize only the GCC-specific composite -mtune value to cortex-a53.  This
    matches the value already supplied by the LLVM project configuration; all
    other environment flags remain unchanged.
    
    The resulting spec was built in the armv7l and aarch64 GCC-default and LLVM
    environments.  All four builds used Clang 22.1.8, completed successfully,
    linked libc++ and libc++abi against libgcc_s.so.1, and installed the five
    checked forced-unwind header changes.
    
    中文说明：显式使用目标三元组前缀的 Clang。此前的
    _toolchain_override 在 Tizen-Base 环境中不会改变 RPM 编译器宏，因而
    仍会选中 GCC。对于“GCC 默认环境中由本包指定 Clang”的 aarch64 组合，
    仅将 GCC 专用的复合 -mtune 参数规范化为 LLVM 配置所用的 cortex-a53；
    其余参数保持不变。两架构、两环境共四格验证均已通过。
    
    Change-Id: I088643ca32ce84bd4f065309a3cd32fb5a6e7a19

commit dd4beffc30be18841818651756f4dbe1f54b0016
Author: hao.lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
Commit: hao.lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>

    packaging: force Clang for libc++ runtimes
    
    This addresses review feedback that %{__cc} and %{__cxx} can resolve to GCC while the runtime configuration passes the Clang driver option --rtlib=libgcc. Force the platform toolchain selector to Clang, following the existing llvm.spec convention, while leaving target triples and cross-compilation settings unchanged.
    
    中文说明：回应评审关于编译器宏可能解析为 GCC 的意见。明确强制使用 Clang，保留现有目标三元组与交叉编译设置不变。
    
    Change-Id: Ib5ad0875af75aed81c767ae96b954b065e7c2877

